<h2>Appendix C: Input / Output Specifications</h2>

<h3>C.1 User Input Payload Specifications</h3>
<table>
  <tr>
    <th>Operation</th>
    <th>Mandatory Fields</th>
    <th>Optional Fields</th>
    <th>Validation Criteria</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Log Income</strong></td>
    <td><code>amount</code>, <code>source</code>, <code>date</code></td>
    <td><code>notes</code>, <code>isRecurring</code></td>
    <td>Amount &gt; 0; Date must be a valid ISO `YYYY-MM-DD` string; Source non-empty.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Log Expense</strong></td>
    <td><code>amount</code>, <code>category</code>, <code>date</code>, <code>paymentMethod</code></td>
    <td><code>notes</code></td>
    <td>Amount &gt; 0; Category must match defined category keys; Method required.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Set Category Budget</strong></td>
    <td><code>category</code>, <code>limit</code>, <code>month</code></td>
    <td>None</td>
    <td>Limit &gt;= 0; Month formatted as `YYYY-MM`; One target budget record per category per month.</td>
  </tr>
</table>

