<h2>Appendix D: Detailed Design Models</h2>

<h3>D.1 Year-End Financial Aggregation Data Flow</h3>
<div class="uml-box">
  +-----------------------+     +------------------------+     +------------------------+
  | Incomes Subcollection |     | Expenses Subcollection |     | Budgets Subcollection  |
  +-----------------------+     +------------------------+     +------------------------+
              |                              |                              |
              +--------------+               |               +--------------+
                             v               v               v
                   +---------------------------------------------------+
                   |         Annual Aggregation Selector (useMemo)     |
                   |  - Filters all documents by target year (YYYY)    |
                   |  - Computes 12 separate monthly cashflow buckets  |
                   |  - Sums annual category expenditures              |
                   |  - Computes running cumulative wealth accumulation|
                   +---------------------------------------------------+
                                             |
                                             v
                   +---------------------------------------------------+
                   |                 Reporting UI State                |
                   |  - 12-Month Inflow vs Outflow Bar Chart           |
                   |  - Annual Category Expense Donut Chart            |
                   |  - Cumulative Net Savings Area Chart              |
                   |  - 12-Month Performance Matrix Table              |
                   +---------------------------------------------------+
</div>

